stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "initiated" as initiated
    state "in_progress" as in_progress
    state "finalized" as finalized
    state "failed" as failed
    state "expired" as expired
    [*] --> initiated
    initiated --> in_progress: advance expected logout step
    in_progress --> in_progress: advance expected logout step
    expired --> in_progress: advance expected logout step
    initiated --> finalized: finalize!
    in_progress --> finalized: finalize!
    failed --> finalized: finalize!
    expired --> finalized: finalize!
    initiated --> failed: fail!
    in_progress --> failed: fail!
    expired --> failed: fail!
    finalized --> [*]
    note right of initiated
        Legacy steps: origin_cleared, acme_cleared, sign_cleared; then finalized.
        sign uses origin/acme; acme and base use origin/sign.
        core, side and palm use origin/acme/sign.
        Browser RP origins: base, core, warp, edit, palm and tech.
        Browser RP steps: authority_revoked, authority_cleanup_issued,
        origin_cleanup_issued, origin_rp_session_revoked; then finalized.
        Stored expired entry writer UNKNOWN; clock expiry only refuses.
        failed can finalize if live and expected_step is finalized.
    end note
